{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And Amaziah sent</b> — the priest of Bethel was the priest of the Baal." "<b>In the midst</b> — he will speak openly and the people of the land will not be able to contain, to bear, and behold if you put him to death, all will rejoice."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {0 "Resolved the bare 'כהן הבעל' as 'priest of the Baal' rather than 'priest of Bethel' since the comment glosses the function rather than the title."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:28.944476597Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}